    (property "Note" "With C-RX-MOD, the low-pass in front of U-RX-MOD's Schmitt input: the cable's crosstalk and reflections last about one round trip (~20 ns) and this stretches that into less than the input's hysteresis can see. 1k in series is near-open to the line, so it does not change the line's own termination. interfaces/spi-link/sim" (at 40.64 213.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
